WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:05.630
Baby puffins are called "Pufflings".

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:19.830
11 of the 12 men to have walked on the Moon
were in the Boy Scouts.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:28.570
Every month in the Netherlands, 133 billion
insects are killed colliding into cars.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:35.870
Squirrels can remember the hiding places of
up to 10,000 nuts.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:40.989
In 2011, cheese was the most stolen food in
the world.

00:00:40.989 --> 00:00:48.500
During pregnancy, some women crave non-edible
items, such as paper, clay and metal, it's

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.879
an eating disorder known as Pica.

00:00:50.879 --> 00:00:59.410
A man from Florida was arrested after calling
911 three times asking the dispatcher if she

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:03.339
was interested in going on a date with him.

00:01:03.339 --> 00:01:10.780
Gladiator sweat was used as a beauty product
for one's skin in Ancient Rome.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:18.320
The expiration date on bottled water is actually
for the bottle, not the water.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:26.410
The most times a person has been stung by
bees without dying is 2,443.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:33.610
Dogs can smell where electric current has
been and human fingerprints that are a week

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:34.610
old.

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:41.910
Under the provisions of the 1912 Scottish
Protection of Animals Act, the Loch Ness monster

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:44.670
is a protected species.

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:51.980
The lion used in the original MGM movie logo
killed its trainer and two assistants the

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:56.210
day after the logo sequence was filmed.

00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:02.630
California consumes more bottled water than
any other product.

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.310
Spiders are extremely carnivorous.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:13.850
10,000 spiders sealed in a room will eventually
result in one enormously fat spider.

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:21.259
Lava can flow as fast as a sprinting greyhound.

